odo-take/1.1
name: Resurrections (bars from the end), v1
by: Lena Raine (Celeste, 2018); as played on piano by Katherine Cordova; written for odo by Claude
about: Ten seconds of a piano cover of "Resurrections" from the game Celeste (music by Lena Raine,
about: 2018, under copyright: only this short excerpt, to learn from). Katherine Cordova's piano
about: cover on YouTube (QDNhe1Vy0No), 5:38.4 to 5:49: the A-B-C-E figure goes round, E comes in
about: low, and the tune climbs C D E, leaps to A and falls to G#, then it slows and fades.
about: Written from the recording by ear and by its spectrum, not from her sheet music.
about: On the Hex, Wicki-Hayden, as a piano: no bends, no vibrato, no slides. Held notes stand
about: for the pedal. Version 1: the notes alone, no effects.
tempo: 84
meter: 4/4
key: A minor
controller: patrickreynolds/hex
settings: {"hexLayout": 0, "tuning": 0, "chromatic": 1, "scale": 1, "key": 9, "octave": 0, "cols": 6, "colours": 3, "vibrato": 0, "slide": 0, "slideOnly": 0, "outOn": 0, "xTarget": 0, "yTarget": 0, "insideDyn": 1, "insideTone": 0, "press": 2, "latch": 0}
sound: patrickreynolds/piano

score
key A3 minor

# The tune: right hand, on top.
voice tune
press 0.6
section Pick-up and E
say Two notes up into the E: C, D
bar 0 4
C5:1/2(press 0.62) D5:1/2(press 0.66)
bar 1
say Hold the E: the low E and B come in with it
E5:4(press 0.62)
section Up to A, down to G#
bar 2
say Leap up to A, then lean down onto G#
A5:2(press 0.85) G#5:2+4(press 0.75)

# The time: steady, then slowing down at the end.
voice time
bar 3
section Slowing to the end
say Let it slow down and fade
tempo 70
r:2
tempo 62
r:2
tempo 54

# The low E and B: left hand, held all through, as the pedal would.
voice low
bar 1
press 0.7
E2+B2:12+2

# The figure: E A B C round and round, an eighth each. Each note is held for two beats,
# as the pedal holds it: one finger for each of the four notes.
voice e
bar 1
press 0.5
E4:2 E4:2 E4:2 E4:2(press 0.45) E4:2(press 0.42) E4:2(press 0.38) E4:2(press 0.25)

voice a
bar 1
press 0.52
r:1/2 A3:2 A3:2 A3:2 A3:2(press 0.48) A3:2(press 0.42) A3:2(press 0.3)

voice b
bar 0 4
press 0.5
B3:2 B3:2 B3:2 B3:2 B3:2(press 0.45) B3:2(press 0.4) B3:2(press 0.3)

voice c
bar 0 4+1/2
press 0.48
C4:2 C4:2 C4:2 C4:2 C4:2(press 0.42) C4:2(press 0.38) C4:2(press 0.28)
end
